#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_appearance.rst:5
msgid "Folio conductor appearance"
msgstr "Folio导体的出现"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_appearance.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Appearance** tab from folio properties PopUP window allows pre-"
"defining the `conductor appearance`_ of the conductors that will be drawn in"
" the folio later. If all conductors from the folio should have the same "
"appearance, this action avoid defining individually the `conductor "
"appearance`_."
msgstr ""
"**Appearance** 来自folio属性的标签 PopUP 窗口允许预先定义在folio中绘制的导体的 `导体外观 <conductor "
"appearance_>`_ 。如果folio中的所有导体都具有相同的外观，则此动作避免单独定义 `导体外观 <conductor "
"appearance_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_appearance.rst:13
msgid ""
"For more information about conductor properties, refer to `conductor "
"appearance`_ section."
msgstr "关于导体属性的更多信息，参见 `导体外观 <conductor appearance_>`_ 节。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_appearance.rst:19
msgid "Figure: Folio appearance properties"
msgstr "图：Folio 外观属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_appearance.rst:23
msgid ""
"For more information about how to display folio properties, refer to "
"`display folio properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于如何显示folio属性的更多信息，请参见 `display folio属性 <display folio properties_>`_ 一节。"
